{
  "declined": "none",
  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "task",
      "score": 5,
      "reason": "文章完整回答題目，明確表達立場（\"I agree that universities in Taiwan should teach more courses in English\"）並以多個理由與例子支持觀點。"
    },
    {
      "id": "organization",
      "score": 5,
      "reason": "作文有清楚的段落結構（引言、三個支持段落、反對意見段落、實施建議與結論），過渡自然如 \"The first reason\"、\"However\"、\"In conclusion\"。"
    },
    {
      "id": "vocabulary",
      "score": 4,
      "reason": "用詞大多準確且適合學術討論（如 \"international language\", \"technical documents\", \"recorded lectures\"），但偶有較普通或重複用詞（例如多次使用 \"more\" 和 \"courses\"）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "grammar",
      "score": 4,
      "reason": "整體語法正確，句型多樣，但有少數語法或用法瑕疵（如 \"have difficulty to read\" 應為 \"have difficulty reading\" 等）。"
    }
  ],
  "issues": [
    {
      "quote": "they may have difficulty to read these papers or join international discussions after they graduate.",
      "type": "grammar",
      "why": "固定用法應為 \"have difficulty + -ing\"，使用不定詞不符合慣用句型。",
      "suggestion": "they may have difficulty reading these papers or joining international discussions after they graduate."
    },
    {
      "quote": "he had to read a lot of technical documents in English every day, and at first it was very hard for him because he had never taken a course in English.",
      "type": "cohesion",
      "why": "句子資訊多且冗長，可分割以提高清晰度與流暢度。",
      "suggestion": "he had to read many technical documents in English every day. At first, it was very hard because he had never taken a course taught in English."
    },
    {
      "quote": "If students only learn their major in Chinese, they may have difficulty to read these papers or join international discussions after they graduate.",
      "type": "word-choice",
      "why": "'learn their major in Chinese' 聽起來不自然，應改為更常用的表達方式。",
      "suggestion": "If students study their majors only in Chinese, they may have difficulty reading these papers or joining international discussions after graduation."
    }
  ],
  "more": [
    {
      "quote": "most university courses should be taught in English in the future",
      "type": "tone",
      "why": "用語較絕對（\"most\"、\"should\"）；在討論敏感政策時可稍微緩和語氣以顯得更客觀。",
      "suggestion": "many university courses should be offered in English in the future"
    },
    {
      "quote": "they could have adapted to his job much faster.",
      "type": "grammar",
      "why": "時態與語氣略有不自然，過去完成或條件句表達會更精確。",
      "suggestion": "he could have adapted to his job much faster."
    },
    {
      "quote": "Professors who teach in English should receive training, and they could be allowed to use some Chinese to explain very difficult concepts.",
      "type": "cohesion",
      "why": "句中 'could be allowed' 與前文 'should receive' 的語氣不一致，可統一以清晰建議呈現。",
      "suggestion": "Professors who teach in English should receive training and may use some Chinese to explain very difficult concepts."
    },
    {
      "quote": "This kind of practice is much more useful than only memorizing vocabulary for an exam.",
      "type": "word-choice",
      "why": "'memorizing vocabulary for an exam' 可更精確表達為應試式學習或詞彙記憶。",
      "suggestion": "This kind of practice is much more useful than merely memorizing vocabulary for exams."
    },
    {
      "quote": "If this plan is carried out in a careful way, I believe it will make Taiwanese students more competitive in the world.",
      "type": "word-choice",
      "why": "'in a careful way' 稍顯口語，學術寫作可用更正式的表達。",
      "suggestion": "If this plan is implemented carefully, I believe it will make Taiwanese students more globally competitive."
    }
  ],
  "strengths": [
    {
      "quote": "The first reason why I support more English courses is that English is the most important international language.",
      "why": "開門見山提出主要論點，表明立場並為下文鋪陳理由，結構清晰。"
    },
    {
      "quote": "For instance, in one of my general education classes, which was taught in English, there were students from Japan, Vietnam, France and India.",
      "why": "使用具體例子支持論點，增加說服力且顯示個人經驗的反思。"
    }
  ],
  "summary": "你已經寫出一篇結構良好、論證清楚的文章，接下來請注意幾個常見的文法與用法：改正固定搭配（如 \"have difficulty + -ing\"）、避免過長句子並適度分句，以及選用更精確的詞彙（如 \"study their majors\"、\"implemented carefully\"）。繼續用具體例子支持主張，並在修改時關注句子連貫與語氣一致，會讓你的文章更成熟專業。"
}
